{"ok":true,"data":{"newsId":"NEWS-2026-00026","title":"𝐀𝐃𝐀𝐁_𝐄𝐏𝟎𝟎𝟒","slug":"","summary":"Adab di bilik kuliah membentuk disiplin, karakter dan profesionalisme bakal jurutera. Amalkan sikap hormat, fokus dan penglibatan aktif agar proses pembelajaran lebih bermakna serta diberkati.","categoryId":"CAT-0DCF6299","categoryName":"Inspirasi dan Perkongsian","authorName":"mohdzaki","imageUrl":"https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1fdJTVBDRmpAWudj8DmKw6LvVHrz87UBa&sz=w1200","publishedAt":"12/10/2026","publishedAtRaw":1791773419759,"eventDate":"18/09/2026","views":0,"readMinutes":1,"lang":"en","hasFallback":true,"hasEnglish":false,"content":"Bilik kuliah bukan sekadar tempat menerima ilmu, tetapi ruang untuk membentuk disiplin dan karakter seorang bakal jurutera. Catat perkara penting, elakkan berbual perkara yang tidak berkaitan, kekalkan fokus dan libatkan diri secara aktif dalam pembelajaran. Jangan takut untuk bertanya, tetapi sampaikan soalan dengan penuh hormat. Pada masa yang sama, gunakan peranti secara berhemah agar tidak menjadi gangguan. Apabila ilmu dipelajari bersama adab, pembelajaran menjadi lebih bermakna dan membawa keberkatan.<p></p>","fallbackFields":["Title","Summary","Content"],"seoTitle":"𝐀𝐃𝐀𝐁_𝐄𝐏𝟎𝟎𝟒","seoDescription":"","seoKeywords":"","shareUrl":"https://fkm-it.github.io/fkm-news?view=reader&id=NEWS-2026-00026&lang=en","shareIsPublic":true,"tags":"#JumaatBeradab, #ADAB, #MenjiwakanKejuruteraan, #FKMUTM, #UniversitiTeknologiMalaysia, #EngineeringWithAdab","images":[{"imageId":"IMG-00050","newsId":"NEWS-2026-00026","fileId":"1fdJTVBDRmpAWudj8DmKw6LvVHrz87UBa","fileName":"813583132_1598320915666088_8000184175489657529_n.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","sizeBytes":167837,"sizeLabel":"164 KB","caption":"","altText":"","sortOrder":1,"isFeatured":true,"isSelectedForSocial":true,"thumbUrl":"https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1fdJTVBDRmpAWudj8DmKw6LvVHrz87UBa&sz=w1200","viewUrl":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1fdJTVBDRmpAWudj8DmKw6LvVHrz87UBa/view","uploaded